drift[10]{cap,convention,reality,where}:
  cap-testing-strategy,"Vitest, files named <name>.test.ts","apps/api uses Jest exclusively — 150 *.spec.ts files, 143 importing @nestjs/testing, zero vitest imports. Vitest is web-only (28 *.test.ts). The unit/integration split (fake repos for services, faked facade for controller tests) IS followed",apps/api/package.json + apps/api/src/**/*.spec.ts vs apps/web/vitest.config.ts
  cap-api-endpoint,"validate input with a schema (e.g. Zod) at the boundary","no Zod anywhere in the sampled controllers — validation is NestJS DTO classes with class-validator decorators plus @ApiProperty for OpenAPI generation",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/dto/create-user.dto.ts
  cap-api-endpoint,no business logic in the handler,"controllers run logic inline: users.controller.ts create() validates the password policy (~L87-114) and findAll() slices pagination (~L213-235) instead of delegating",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/users.controller.ts
  cap-service,"framework-free service: never imports the HTTP framework","services throw NestJS HTTP exceptions (BadRequestException/ConflictException/NotFoundException/UnauthorizedException) directly, coupling the service layer to HTTP",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/services/users-management.service.ts
  cap-service,"typed domain errors (class XxxError extends Error) thrown by the service","exactly one domain error class exists repo-wide (PokemonNotFoundError); everything else throws generic Error or Nest HttpExceptions",apps/api/src/api/smartrotom/ficusai/errors/pokemon-not-found.error.ts (the lone case)
  cap-service,"no direct DB access in the service — delegate to a repository","12 services inject DRIZZLE directly with no repository, each self-tagged // LEGACY_DIRECT_DB; scripts/check-layering.mjs pins LEGACY_BASELINE=12 and only lets it go down",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/{community,notifications,public-profile,suggestions}/*.service.ts + events/{events.facade.service.ts,services/{leaderboards,profile,progress}.service.ts} + auth/{email-verification,password-reset}.service.ts + smartrotom/_main/smartrotom.service.ts + app.service.ts
  cap-service,one <Feature>Service per use-case area,"two-tier shape the cap does not describe: a <feature>.facade.service.ts fronts several services/*.service.ts collaborators (the collaborators themselves stay DB-free)",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/ + smartrotom/pokemon/ + wingull/invites/
  cap-service,"domain types in src/<feature>/<feature>.types.ts","only 4 modules have a <feature>.types.ts; sampled domains keep domain types inline in the facade or in the repository-interface file",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/tournaments/tournaments.types.ts + smartrotom/{pasaporte,rooker}/types/ are the only ones
  cap-data-access,"business code depends on the repository interface, never the concrete class","the interface exists but the service constructor is typed to the concrete class BoffMediaUsersRepository, not IBoffMediaUsersRepository",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/services/users-management.service.ts vs repositories/interfaces/users.repository.interface.ts
  cap-data-access,"no business logic in the repository — only queries and row↔domain mapping","deleteUser() implements the GDPR soft-delete policy (tombstone naming, PII scrubbing, cascading nickname anonymisation) inside the repository",apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/repositories/users.repository.ts (deleteUser ~L532-581)
follows[2]{cap,confirmed}:
  cap-data-access,"one <Feature>Repository per aggregate over drizzle, query-builder only, no string-concatenated SQL — verified in users.repository.ts, smartrotom/pokemon/repositories/pokemon.repository.ts, _repositories/boffmedia/invites.repository.ts"
  cap-testing-strategy,"the test SHAPE is followed even though the runner differs: services tested against fake repositories, controllers via *.integration.spec.ts with a faked facade — apps/api/src/api/boffmedia/users/{services/users-management.service.spec.ts,users.controller.integration.spec.ts}"
